- Update `package.json` and `package-lock.json` together.
- Use deterministic browser installation and test setup.
- Ensure CI does not require private production credentials.
- Provide safe, clearly identified test fixtures and mock services where required.
- Do not allow test mocks to imply that a production service is live.
- Upload useful test reports or screenshots when CI supports them.
- Keep secrets out of logs and browser bundles.
- Fail CI on genuine test failures; do not weaken tests to force a green result.

